    "answer": "(a) \\(H_{min1}=2(1-0.75q)\\)；(b) \\(H_{min2}=(1-0.75q)/(1-0.5q)^2\\)，\\(H_{lp}=z-2.5+z^{-1}\\)；均唯一到常数。",
